# good: lamp and motor share one loop, so each gets less push (dim).
kits scb20
grid 7x5 grid-mini
step 1: grid
step 2: B3B at 1A dir=right side=up level=1
step 3: S1 at 1C dir=down level=1
step 4: L4 at 3E dir=right level=1
step 5: M7 at 5C dir=left level=1
step 6: wire3 at 1A dir=down level=2
step 7: wire3 at 1E dir=right level=2
step 8: wire3 at 5E dir=up level=2
step 9: wire3 at 3C dir=up level=2
expect S1=on: L4 on dim
expect S1=on: M7 on dim
expect S1=off: L4 off
